          <a href="#how-we-tested" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. How We Chose for Walkers</a>
          <a href="#specs-that-matter" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. The Specs That Actually Matter</a>
          <a href="#picks" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. The 6 Best Walking Treadmills</a>
          <a href="#price-check" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. Black Friday and Cyber Monday Price Check</a>
          <a href="#format" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">6. Full Treadmill or Walking Pad?</a>
          <a href="#speed-motor" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">7. Walking Speed and Motor Size for Walking Only</a>
          <a href="#deck-length" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">8. Deck Length for Walking vs. Running</a>
          <a href="#incline" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. Incline: A Walker's Substitute for Speed</a>
