              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">THERUN 20% Auto Incline</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Up to 12 mph</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">3.5 HP, not labelled continuous or peak</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Probably fine, but the figure cannot be compared directly</td></tr>
